(6606337, 985444, 138630, '<td valign="top">Talk about a traditional Thanksgiving meal -- this is a wonderful candid.  I love that you caught some people like the couple on the left back prepared for the shot, others like the young lady on the right covering her mouth surprised by it, and yet others like great grandma? in front on the left oblivious and totally focused on what''s important -- that delicious turkey.  I like the tones and processing, too.</td>', 'Talk about a traditional Thanksgiving meal -- this is a wonderful candid.  I love that you caught some people like the couple on the left back prepared for the shot, others like the young lady on the right covering her mouth surprised by it, and yet others like great grandma? in front on the left oblivious and totally focused on what''s important -- that delicious turkey.  I like the tones and processing, too.', '2011-11-30 09:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
