(6606391, 986099, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is precious, beautiful little faces. Nice sharpness on the fur.</td>', 'This is precious, beautiful little faces. Nice sharpness on the fur.', '2011-11-30 10:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606393, 986023, 94265, '<td valign="top">A nice family snap (there is always one!) but I do wish the funnyman was in better focus.</td>', 'A nice family snap (there is always one!) but I do wish the funnyman was in better focus.', '2011-11-30 10:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606397, 985770, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great focus, lovely colours, the greens really pop. Lovely location too. Not sure I''m feeling the title with the shot; the photo does say family to me, I see a sister sitting with her younger brothers while they play, there is a familial feel to it (and I understand there are individuals in every family) but I don''t personally think it goes.</td>', 'Great focus, lovely colours, the greens really pop. Lovely location too. Not sure I''m feeling the title with the shot; the photo does say family to me, I see a sister sitting with her younger brothers while they play, there is a familial feel to it (and I understand there are individuals in every family) but I don''t personally think it goes.', '2011-11-30 10:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606399, 985422, 94265, '<td valign="top">The bokeh on the material of the cap looks a little odd, as textured things sometimes do on a bokehd macro but the focus is very nice on the 2005 and the string. The gold stands out nicely but not too much against the black, white and grey shades. I don''t think the title needed to tell us what your subject is, it''s nice enough with the idea of recalling a proud family moment.</td>', 'The bokeh on the material of the cap looks a little odd, as textured things sometimes do on a bokehd macro but the focus is very nice on the 2005 and the string. The gold stands out nicely but not too much against the black, white and grey shades. I don''t think the title needed to tell us what your subject is, it''s nice enough with the idea of recalling a proud family moment.', '2011-11-30 10:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606402, 986057, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cute setup. I wonder if this were on grass (real or fake) if it would have had an even larger impact.</td>', 'Very cute setup. I wonder if this were on grass (real or fake) if it would have had an even larger impact.', '2011-11-30 10:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606403, 985680, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice memory, it''s too bad the dogs face isn''t in focus as well. That''s the tough part about using a wide aperture.</td>', 'Nice memory, it''s too bad the dogs face isn''t in focus as well. That''s the tough part about using a wide aperture.', '2011-11-30 10:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606404, 985593, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, posing, and B&amp;W. But I''m curious why you chose a frame where one girl has her eyes shut.</td>', 'I like the idea, posing, and B&W. But I''m curious why you chose a frame where one girl has her eyes shut.', '2011-11-30 10:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606405, 986044, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. with some improvements, I think this could have have been really nice. For instance, the background could be all bright white, and the brush heads could be much sharper.</td>', 'Cute idea. with some improvements, I think this could have have been really nice. For instance, the background could be all bright white, and the brush heads could be much sharper.', '2011-11-30 10:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606406, 986109, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice outside the box thinking.</td>', 'Nice outside the box thinking.', '2011-11-30 10:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606407, 986028, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute photo! Love their expressions.</td>', 'Cute photo! Love their expressions.', '2011-11-30 10:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606408, 986088, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if this was shot underwater or through aquarium glass? I''m guessing glass, as the image is quite noisy and not very sharp. Overall it could do with brightening up and denoising, for me personally it''s not a very interesting shot as it stands. Needs a defined point of focus.</td>', 'I''m wondering if this was shot underwater or through aquarium glass? I''m guessing glass, as the image is quite noisy and not very sharp. Overall it could do with brightening up and denoising, for me personally it''s not a very interesting shot as it stands. Needs a defined point of focus.', '2011-11-30 10:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606409, 985964, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a fun idea.</td>', 'What a fun idea.', '2011-11-30 10:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
