(6606499, 985680, 46918, '<td valign="top">Look it''s "Turner and Hooch"...Sorry that''s an old movie. I like the pic. Looks too cold for me though.</td>', 'Look it''s "Turner and Hooch"...Sorry that''s an old movie. I like the pic. Looks too cold for me though.', '2011-11-30 12:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606502, 985464, 46918, '<td valign="top">looks like more of a snapshot.</td>', 'looks like more of a snapshot.', '2011-11-30 12:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606532, 985666, 94265, '<td valign="top">A teeny bit bright in places but very little detail lost as a result so that''s Ok. Beautiful dog, nice composition, made me smile. I can''t make out what the green thing is that''s sitting on top of the middle wellies but I wish it wasn''t there, since I can''t make out what it is my eye is kinda going to it a bit more than it should. Plus, it''s obscuring more of that lovely doggie; maybe that way the intent though with a white chest in such bright sun.</td>', 'A teeny bit bright in places but very little detail lost as a result so that''s Ok. Beautiful dog, nice composition, made me smile. I can''t make out what the green thing is that''s sitting on top of the middle wellies but I wish it wasn''t there, since I can''t make out what it is my eye is kinda going to it a bit more than it should. Plus, it''s obscuring more of that lovely doggie; maybe that way the intent though with a white chest in such bright sun.', '2011-11-30 13:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606536, 985939, 94265, '<td valign="top">Rare to get perfect eye contact from the family pet, haha. This is a nice happy shot, it would indeed make a nice xmas card for friends and family. Good exposure, nice focus, it certainly portrays family. My only niggle would be that the main subjects are half-way down the shot, although I understand you wanted the tree in there too. A very nice image overall.</td>', 'Rare to get perfect eye contact from the family pet, haha. This is a nice happy shot, it would indeed make a nice xmas card for friends and family. Good exposure, nice focus, it certainly portrays family. My only niggle would be that the main subjects are half-way down the shot, although I understand you wanted the tree in there too. A very nice image overall.', '2011-11-30 13:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606544, 986044, 140777, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea and great outcome!</td>', 'Wonderful idea and great outcome!', '2011-11-30 13:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606647, 986028, 138630, '<td valign="top">Sweet capture -- these two so obviously love and enjoy one another.  Wish the tones were as lively as the expressions -- maybe adjust the levels?  And I would rotate clockwise just a little bit.</td>', 'Sweet capture -- these two so obviously love and enjoy one another.  Wish the tones were as lively as the expressions -- maybe adjust the levels?  And I would rotate clockwise just a little bit.', '2011-11-30 16:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606667, 985964, 138630, '<td valign="top">Great poses in silhouette and I love them against the orange and white.  I would crop severely -- don''t see why any loss in detail would matter but I may be wrong.  Maybe a severe pano with a bit off the left and lots off the top and bottom.  Then you could set it off with a double top and bottom border -- narrow white and a wide brownish orange -- to bring it back to a 2:3 ratio.</td>', 'Great poses in silhouette and I love them against the orange and white.  I would crop severely -- don''t see why any loss in detail would matter but I may be wrong.  Maybe a severe pano with a bit off the left and lots off the top and bottom.  Then you could set it off with a double top and bottom border -- narrow white and a wide brownish orange -- to bring it back to a 2:3 ratio.', '2011-11-30 17:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606668, 986044, 138630, '<td valign="top">Good idea and I do think family when I see this.</td>', 'Good idea and I do think family when I see this.', '2011-11-30 17:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606672, 986100, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like that they are holding hands -- strengthens the connection.  Beautiful sunset.</td>', 'I like that they are holding hands -- strengthens the connection.  Beautiful sunset.', '2011-11-30 17:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606681, 985964, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea and very nicely shot, although this doesn''t convey ''family'' to me so much as ''acrobatics''! A different title may have helped, like ''supporting each other'' for example.</td>', 'Very cool idea and very nicely shot, although this doesn''t convey ''family'' to me so much as ''acrobatics''! A different title may have helped, like ''supporting each other'' for example.', '2011-11-30 17:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606683, 985464, 94265, '<td valign="top">I do like this classic idea and they are clearly a loving couple, although that harsh shadow from his face is distracting; a more even light spread would have been good, maybe a flashgun bounce. Placing them in front of a less busy background would have helped too. As it is, it''s a bit snapshotty in my eyes. Nice to see one of these in colour for a change though.</td>', 'I do like this classic idea and they are clearly a loving couple, although that harsh shadow from his face is distracting; a more even light spread would have been good, maybe a flashgun bounce. Placing them in front of a less busy background would have helped too. As it is, it''s a bit snapshotty in my eyes. Nice to see one of these in colour for a change though.', '2011-11-30 17:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606684, 986000, 94265, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit yellow for my tastes, it''s a bit dull also; a more even, brighter light would have improved this I think and helped with sharpness. I''d have cropped out a wee bit too to keep the cap of the Nando''s bottle in the shot. The idea made me smile though!</td>', 'The lighting is a bit yellow for my tastes, it''s a bit dull also; a more even, brighter light would have improved this I think and helped with sharpness. I''d have cropped out a wee bit too to keep the cap of the Nando''s bottle in the shot. The idea made me smile though!', '2011-11-30 17:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606751, 985977, 129222, '<td valign="top">It''s your first challenge Ivy, I''m very proud of you for entering, and because of this I''m going to give you an 8. Keep entering, it''s only going to make you a better photographer. Keep shooting. Lots of love. Roman.</td>', 'It''s your first challenge Ivy, I''m very proud of you for entering, and because of this I''m going to give you an 8. Keep entering, it''s only going to make you a better photographer. Keep shooting. Lots of love. Roman.', '2011-11-30 18:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606796, 985909, 94265, '<td valign="top">Cute little boy, I really like the lighting on this, it''s good that he has catchlights in both eyes. I''m not sure about the composition though; since you can see how wrinkled and sagging the backdrop is, I don''t see the point in having the boy off to one side to show that off. A more centred, closer shot of him might have been a better idea with that backdrop, or maybe next time just make sure the material is pulled tightly at all corners to elimate creases as much as possible. A nice shot overall.</td>', 'Cute little boy, I really like the lighting on this, it''s good that he has catchlights in both eyes. I''m not sure about the composition though; since you can see how wrinkled and sagging the backdrop is, I don''t see the point in having the boy off to one side to show that off. A more centred, closer shot of him might have been a better idea with that backdrop, or maybe next time just make sure the material is pulled tightly at all corners to elimate creases as much as possible. A nice shot overall.', '2011-11-30 20:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606800, 986052, 94265, '<td valign="top">The reflection on the lower half of the ''negative'' is a bit annoying as it makes the individual images look partially cloudy but overall, a cool and clever image.</td>', 'The reflection on the lower half of the ''negative'' is a bit annoying as it makes the individual images look partially cloudy but overall, a cool and clever image.', '2011-11-30 20:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606801, 986097, 94265, '<td valign="top">The cool texture/pattern on the sand looks good in the sunlight, nice to see some people in the background there too, as dogs on the beach do tend to go bolting off miles away! The patch of sky with the sun is very blown and it would''ve been good to see a few more details there but that is a difficult thing to capture. Nice shot overall.</td>', 'The cool texture/pattern on the sand looks good in the sunlight, nice to see some people in the background there too, as dogs on the beach do tend to go bolting off miles away! The patch of sky with the sun is very blown and it would''ve been good to see a few more details there but that is a difficult thing to capture. Nice shot overall.', '2011-11-30 20:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606819, 985414, 140446, '<td valign="top">Really?</td>', 'Really?', '2011-11-30 20:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606839, 985875, 94265, '<td valign="top">A nicely different take on the challenge, I like the angle too, although I''d have liked to see a shallower DOF to blur the busy window in the background a bit more.</td>', 'A nicely different take on the challenge, I like the angle too, although I''d have liked to see a shallower DOF to blur the busy window in the background a bit more.', '2011-11-30 21:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606840, 985974, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice setting and colours, good exposure in the sunglight, nice sharpness on the trees and the little one on the grass; however, the OOF child in the foreground totally grabs my attention away from everything else, which I don''t find to be a good thing since she''s not in focus (my brain says the main thing in the photo should be in focus, lol.)</td>', 'Nice setting and colours, good exposure in the sunglight, nice sharpness on the trees and the little one on the grass; however, the OOF child in the foreground totally grabs my attention away from everything else, which I don''t find to be a good thing since she''s not in focus (my brain says the main thing in the photo should be in focus, lol.)', '2011-11-30 21:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606841, 985997, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally like sepia, although it works for this shot and the title works well with the image. Those white flowers(?) above the frame on the right grab my eye a bit, I''d have moved those out of the shot before taking it. Is the desk in front of a window screen? The marks on it are a little bit distracting but at the same time, they kind of go with the old-timey feel.</td>', 'I don''t normally like sepia, although it works for this shot and the title works well with the image. Those white flowers(?) above the frame on the right grab my eye a bit, I''d have moved those out of the shot before taking it. Is the desk in front of a window screen? The marks on it are a little bit distracting but at the same time, they kind of go with the old-timey feel.', '2011-11-30 21:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606842, 986068, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, cute kid and the candlelight looks great. My two niggles would be that his hand being out of focus is a bit distracting and the candles look like they''re only in a slice of cake, which makes the scene appear a bit false. It may have been set-up for the challenge but a whole cake would have better furthered the illusion. Overall, I do like it, a nice sweet shot.</td>', 'I like the idea, cute kid and the candlelight looks great. My two niggles would be that his hand being out of focus is a bit distracting and the candles look like they''re only in a slice of cake, which makes the scene appear a bit false. It may have been set-up for the challenge but a whole cake would have better furthered the illusion. Overall, I do like it, a nice sweet shot.', '2011-11-30 21:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606843, 985874, 94265, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t portray family for me very well, too much of the subject is obscured by the wooden slats. Were it taken from the other side, it could have been a cute shot of a couple of kids playing/exploring or whatever, which might have put me in mind of sisterly fun. This angle simply doesn''t make the shot very interesting, for me personally.</td>', 'This doesn''t portray family for me very well, too much of the subject is obscured by the wooden slats. Were it taken from the other side, it could have been a cute shot of a couple of kids playing/exploring or whatever, which might have put me in mind of sisterly fun. This angle simply doesn''t make the shot very interesting, for me personally.', '2011-11-30 21:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606844, 986129, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice and bright, great bold colours and nicely crisp overall. Niggles - the shot doesn''t convey family to me at all without the title, plus that line where the light hits the edge of whatever they''re sitting on is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice and bright, great bold colours and nicely crisp overall. Niggles - the shot doesn''t convey family to me at all without the title, plus that line where the light hits the edge of whatever they''re sitting on is a bit distracting.', '2011-11-30 21:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606845, 986020, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is very sweet, a good interpretation since elephants are known for their familial affection and the great care they take of each other. It bothers me a little that the bottom half light is blown out and the top half is jet black, makes it look a bit odd; nice and sharp though and generally, I like this.</td>', 'This is very sweet, a good interpretation since elephants are known for their familial affection and the great care they take of each other. It bothers me a little that the bottom half light is blown out and the top half is jet black, makes it look a bit odd; nice and sharp though and generally, I like this.', '2011-11-30 21:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606846, 985973, 94265, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful cats, lovely colouring. Nice sharpness and bokeh in the shot. The very similar markings/colour of these kitties makes it believeable to me that they are siblings. Lovely shot overall, though the highlights/midtones being bumped a little to brighten the shot a wee bit would have been good.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful cats, lovely colouring. Nice sharpness and bokeh in the shot. The very similar markings/colour of these kitties makes it believeable to me that they are siblings. Lovely shot overall, though the highlights/midtones being bumped a little to brighten the shot a wee bit would have been good.', '2011-11-30 21:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606847, 985932, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not very familial but amusing anyway. The yellow tint on the image is a bit strong.</td>', 'Not very familial but amusing anyway. The yellow tint on the image is a bit strong.', '2011-11-30 21:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606849, 985470, 94265, '<td valign="top">Amusing, moments like these are nice. I like the coloured lights bokehd in the background. There is some noise in the shot but only really noticeable on their faces, a little denoising would help. The contrast is also a bit too dark as there are no details left on his jacket or her hair; a bit of brightening (highlights and midtones) might have improved this. Quite nice overall though, it made me smile.</td>', 'Amusing, moments like these are nice. I like the coloured lights bokehd in the background. There is some noise in the shot but only really noticeable on their faces, a little denoising would help. The contrast is also a bit too dark as there are no details left on his jacket or her hair; a bit of brightening (highlights and midtones) might have improved this. Quite nice overall though, it made me smile.', '2011-11-30 21:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606850, 985222, 94265, '<td valign="top">I understand the title (quite clever) but some might not and the image doesn''t really visually convey family. The highlights are majorly blown as well. I actually don''t hate it as it does have a certain emotive ''something'' to it, this will probably do quite well with the posthumous arty crowd but I can''t see it ranking very high generally.</td>', 'I understand the title (quite clever) but some might not and the image doesn''t really visually convey family. The highlights are majorly blown as well. I actually don''t hate it as it does have a certain emotive ''something'' to it, this will probably do quite well with the posthumous arty crowd but I can''t see it ranking very high generally.', '2011-11-30 21:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606857, 985881, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on square crops (just personally) and the image is a bit grainy, denoising would have improved this for me, plus darkening the contrast a teeny bit to embolden the dark areas. I like the idea though, it wouldn''t work as well without those pics of kids on the wall but because of them, the connection is obvious and the image conveys exactly what the title says.</td>', 'I''m not keen on square crops (just personally) and the image is a bit grainy, denoising would have improved this for me, plus darkening the contrast a teeny bit to embolden the dark areas. I like the idea though, it wouldn''t work as well without those pics of kids on the wall but because of them, the connection is obvious and the image conveys exactly what the title says.', '2011-11-30 21:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606859, 985414, 94265, '<td valign="top">I absolutely adore that song and this is a very emotive shot to go with the title. As sad as it is, it''s interesting to see a sad take on the family idea; It would be so sad if this is your typical view of family, I hope your family memories are not like this. Overall, the shot is sharp, well composed and emotional. Well done.</td>', 'I absolutely adore that song and this is a very emotive shot to go with the title. As sad as it is, it''s interesting to see a sad take on the family idea; It would be so sad if this is your typical view of family, I hope your family memories are not like this. Overall, the shot is sharp, well composed and emotional. Well done.', '2011-11-30 21:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6606898, 985666, 91342, '<td valign="top">Background is a bit bright for my taste.  Cute photo.</td>', 'Background is a bit bright for my taste.  Cute photo.', '2011-11-30 21:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
