(6607155, 985974, 139086, '<td valign="top">Focus is behind the subjects, as I realize your title, that might be what you intended.  I am changing my vote from a 5 to a 7.  :)</td>', 'Focus is behind the subjects, as I realize your title, that might be what you intended.  I am changing my vote from a 5 to a 7.  :)', '2011-12-01 01:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
