(6607294, 985680, 96751, '<td valign="top">A pity the dog is oof</td>', 'A pity the dog is oof', '2011-12-01 05:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607295, 986023, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful family.  Love that the cutup is blurred.  Pooch seems a bit stressed, LOL</td>', 'Beautiful family.  Love that the cutup is blurred.  Pooch seems a bit stressed, LOL', '2011-12-01 05:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607296, 985227, 96751, '<td valign="top">Sweet.  The lighting really makes this a "memory" image</td>', 'Sweet.  The lighting really makes this a "memory" image', '2011-12-01 05:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607297, 985938, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is something so philosophical about this image.  Perhaps it''s that they''re perched at the edge of the dark sand, which has been walked on, and she is imparting wisdom/warnings/encouragement to the little one about navigating uncharted territory</td>', 'There is something so philosophical about this image.  Perhaps it''s that they''re perched at the edge of the dark sand, which has been walked on, and she is imparting wisdom/warnings/encouragement to the little one about navigating uncharted territory', '2011-12-01 05:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607298, 985414, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is very disturbing.</td>', 'This is very disturbing.', '2011-12-01 05:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607299, 985666, 96751, '<td valign="top">Haahaha!  I''m certain he''s wearing a pair (or two) as well!</td>', 'Haahaha!  I''m certain he''s wearing a pair (or two) as well!', '2011-12-01 05:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607300, 986097, 96751, '<td valign="top">The god of frolic.  Brilliant.</td>', 'The god of frolic.  Brilliant.', '2011-12-01 05:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607301, 985973, 96751, '<td valign="top">I faved this because a) it''s cats, and b) it captures that magical something that makes them demonic angels.</td>', 'I faved this because a) it''s cats, and b) it captures that magical something that makes them demonic angels.', '2011-12-01 05:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607302, 985593, 96751, '<td valign="top">Sweet</td>', 'Sweet', '2011-12-01 05:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607303, 985925, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great choice to go b/w</td>', 'Great choice to go b/w', '2011-12-01 05:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607304, 985484, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice candid!</td>', 'Nice candid!', '2011-12-01 05:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607305, 985963, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the tones, Deb.  There''s a twilight-y element about this, which I find very appealing.</td>', 'I love the tones, Deb.  There''s a twilight-y element about this, which I find very appealing.', '2011-12-01 05:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607306, 985631, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Incredible reflection, and perfect silhouettes</td>', 'Beautiful.  Incredible reflection, and perfect silhouettes', '2011-12-01 05:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607307, 986131, 96751, '<td valign="top">Party time!</td>', 'Party time!', '2011-12-01 05:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607309, 986041, 96751, '<td valign="top">Are they all in the same crib?  Or are those the parents in teh back, not sure what to do with the crying baby?</td>', 'Are they all in the same crib?  Or are those the parents in teh back, not sure what to do with the crying baby?', '2011-12-01 05:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607310, 985964, 96751, '<td valign="top">VERY cool.  I would love to have some sort of detail in the darkness, but the formation is terrific!</td>', 'VERY cool.  I would love to have some sort of detail in the darkness, but the formation is terrific!', '2011-12-01 05:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607317, 985631, 108331, '<td valign="top">Beutifull.9</td>', 'Beutifull.9', '2011-12-01 06:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607318, 986082, 108331, '<td valign="top">A nice and sharp photo. Good job! 8</td>', 'A nice and sharp photo. Good job! 8', '2011-12-01 06:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607321, 986093, 108331, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good and the picture is sharp. Well done.9</td>', 'The lighting is good and the picture is sharp. Well done.9', '2011-12-01 06:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607322, 985422, 108331, '<td valign="top">Good photo.8</td>', 'Good photo.8', '2011-12-01 06:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607323, 986129, 108331, '<td valign="top">The hairs on the teddies are sharp. Good work.8</td>', 'The hairs on the teddies are sharp. Good work.8', '2011-12-01 06:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607324, 985973, 108331, '<td valign="top">Well focused and sharp. Well done.9</td>', 'Well focused and sharp. Well done.9', '2011-12-01 06:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607408, 985471, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, I like the bokehd book in the background, really sets off the idea.</td>', 'Nice DOF, I like the bokehd book in the background, really sets off the idea.', '2011-12-01 09:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607409, 985682, 94265, '<td valign="top">While the shot doesn''t really say family to me, she''s a great model and this is a nice shot. I like the pose and outfit, the setting, the exposure and the image is nicely sharp.</td>', 'While the shot doesn''t really say family to me, she''s a great model and this is a nice shot. I like the pose and outfit, the setting, the exposure and the image is nicely sharp.', '2011-12-01 09:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607412, 985631, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, lovely colours, great exposure; looks almost dreamy. A nice moment, the family watching the sunset.</td>', 'Very nice shot, lovely colours, great exposure; looks almost dreamy. A nice moment, the family watching the sunset.', '2011-12-01 09:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607414, 985938, 94265, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see it cropped in a little mor so we could see the child''s face better, seeing an expression here would have been nice. Good photo overall though, perfect exposure, nice and sharp.</td>', 'I would have liked to see it cropped in a little mor so we could see the child''s face better, seeing an expression here would have been nice. Good photo overall though, perfect exposure, nice and sharp.', '2011-12-01 09:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607416, 985484, 94265, '<td valign="top">A good family moment captured, certainly meets the challenge. If this was a candid shot it''s very good, the focus is great. I like the different colours. A few patches of overexposure in the sun but nothing that grabs the eye, so that''s Ok. A shallower DOF may have been good for blurring the busy background a bit but again, it''s not too eye-grabbing so it''s Ok. I think this one will probably do quite well.</td>', 'A good family moment captured, certainly meets the challenge. If this was a candid shot it''s very good, the focus is great. I like the different colours. A few patches of overexposure in the sun but nothing that grabs the eye, so that''s Ok. A shallower DOF may have been good for blurring the busy background a bit but again, it''s not too eye-grabbing so it''s Ok. I think this one will probably do quite well.', '2011-12-01 09:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607419, 985680, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, kids and animals work well for this challenge, always puts me in mind of the ''family pet'' which every kid loves. Beautiful dog, is he a Bordeaux? The DOF is good, although having the dog in clear focus as well would have been nice since the shot title is about both of them, the focus as it is makes the shot more about the boy. I like it overall, good exposure and a lovely subject.</td>', 'Nice shot, kids and animals work well for this challenge, always puts me in mind of the ''family pet'' which every kid loves. Beautiful dog, is he a Bordeaux? The DOF is good, although having the dog in clear focus as well would have been nice since the shot title is about both of them, the focus as it is makes the shot more about the boy. I like it overall, good exposure and a lovely subject.', '2011-12-01 09:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607466, 986044, 94265, '<td valign="top">A cool interpretation of the challenge. I like the different colours. There''s some noise on the image (most noticeable on the grey background), a bit of denoising would help. The glass looks to me to be sitting on a piece of curling paper too? (Unless it''s an oddly-shaped shelf, lol.) I might have been inclined not to do that, as it''s a bit distracting that the glass is sitting on a strangely uneven surface.</td>', 'A cool interpretation of the challenge. I like the different colours. There''s some noise on the image (most noticeable on the grey background), a bit of denoising would help. The glass looks to me to be sitting on a piece of curling paper too? (Unless it''s an oddly-shaped shelf, lol.) I might have been inclined not to do that, as it''s a bit distracting that the glass is sitting on a strangely uneven surface.', '2011-12-01 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607469, 986057, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is cute, nice focus and DOF. The magenta hues on the image are a bit too strong though, it overpowers the other colours, I''d have lowered the magenta channel a bit.</td>', 'This is cute, nice focus and DOF. The magenta hues on the image are a bit too strong though, it overpowers the other colours, I''d have lowered the magenta channel a bit.', '2011-12-01 09:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607475, 986109, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed, good sharpness, nice perspective; however, the image doesn''t say ''family'', even with the title.</td>', 'Nicely exposed, good sharpness, nice perspective; however, the image doesn''t say ''family'', even with the title.', '2011-12-01 09:54:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6607476, 985925, 94265, '<td valign="top">Typical kids, lol. I like the title. Feels a little bit cramped though, I''d have cropped (or taken, whichever) the shot further out, so there was more of the kids in the frame. I''d have also maybe had them standing further forward of the thing they''re in front of, to help blur it a little. Cute shot though, quite nice focus too.</td>', 'Typical kids, lol. I like the title. Feels a little bit cramped though, I''d have cropped (or taken, whichever) the shot further out, so there was more of the kids in the frame. I''d have also maybe had them standing further forward of the thing they''re in front of, to help blur it a little. Cute shot though, quite nice focus too.', '2011-12-01 09:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607510, 986082, 96751, '<td valign="top">Too cute</td>', 'Too cute', '2011-12-01 10:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607525, 985222, 96751, '<td valign="top">The downpour is brazenly palpable.  The family off-camera, dashing for the car, grabbing cups and plates.</td>', 'The downpour is brazenly palpable.  The family off-camera, dashing for the car, grabbing cups and plates.', '2011-12-01 10:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607527, 985889, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the pp''ing.  A pity that rebar crisscrosses throughout the image.</td>', 'Love the pp''ing.  A pity that rebar crisscrosses throughout the image.', '2011-12-01 10:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607528, 986100, 96751, '<td valign="top">They look like cutouts!</td>', 'They look like cutouts!', '2011-12-01 10:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607530, 985980, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wish you''d used a deeper dof!!! fascinating.</td>', 'Wish you''d used a deeper dof!!! fascinating.', '2011-12-01 10:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607531, 986106, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting image dynamics.  Powerful sense of movement.</td>', 'Interesting image dynamics.  Powerful sense of movement.', '2011-12-01 10:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607532, 986020, 96751, '<td valign="top">Amazing how such enormous creatures can be so sweet</td>', 'Amazing how such enormous creatures can be so sweet', '2011-12-01 10:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607533, 985682, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait</td>', 'Lovely portrait', '2011-12-01 10:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607534, 986052, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like a family anchored by cats.</td>', 'I like a family anchored by cats.', '2011-12-01 10:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607535, 986033, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love those ears!!!</td>', 'Love those ears!!!', '2011-12-01 10:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607536, 986110, 96751, '<td valign="top">A very moving moment, where it appears the granddaughter doesn''t want to go to grandpa.</td>', 'A very moving moment, where it appears the granddaughter doesn''t want to go to grandpa.', '2011-12-01 10:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607537, 986028, 96751, '<td valign="top">Precious!</td>', 'Precious!', '2011-12-01 10:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607538, 986099, 96751, '<td valign="top">Jenn????  Just guessing ''cause her dog just had puppies.  Regardless, these are adorable</td>', 'Jenn????  Just guessing ''cause her dog just had puppies.  Regardless, these are adorable', '2011-12-01 10:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607559, 986028, 94265, '<td valign="top">Adorable shot, that little girl''s expression is especially lovely. A very sweet moment between the big brother and his little sister. :-) I think the Hello Kitty is a wee bit distracting (the block bit of white) so I''d have taken the headband off her before taking the shot. I would like to see this with slightly brighter highlights, midtones and some deepened contrast. Very nice shot overall.</td>', 'Adorable shot, that little girl''s expression is especially lovely. A very sweet moment between the big brother and his little sister. :-) I think the Hello Kitty is a wee bit distracting (the block bit of white) so I''d have taken the headband off her before taking the shot. I would like to see this with slightly brighter highlights, midtones and some deepened contrast. Very nice shot overall.', '2011-12-01 11:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607574, 985784, 94265, '<td valign="top">A strange entry, not quite sure what to make of it; interesting items, the focus is nice and sharp, however the image itself doesn''t portray ''family'' to me.</td>', 'A strange entry, not quite sure what to make of it; interesting items, the focus is nice and sharp, however the image itself doesn''t portray ''family'' to me.', '2011-12-01 11:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607578, 985977, 94265, '<td valign="top">Neither the photo nor the title conveys the idea of family. A bit noisy also and not a wholly interesting subject. Nice colours but a low-scorer for me, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Neither the photo nor the title conveys the idea of family. A bit noisy also and not a wholly interesting subject. Nice colours but a low-scorer for me, I''m afraid.', '2011-12-01 11:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607580, 986099, 69368, '<td valign="top">really cute</td>', 'really cute', '2011-12-01 11:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607582, 986041, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen many faces-on-eggs shots and normally I like them but I can''t quite work out this one, lol. Why is one of them ''crying''? What are they sitting on and why? I''m not sure how this conveys family, maybe I''m missing an obvious joke! DOF and focus are fine, lighting not so much as the dark patch at the bottom half is trying to pull my eye away from your egg characters.</td>', 'I''ve seen many faces-on-eggs shots and normally I like them but I can''t quite work out this one, lol. Why is one of them ''crying''? What are they sitting on and why? I''m not sure how this conveys family, maybe I''m missing an obvious joke! DOF and focus are fine, lighting not so much as the dark patch at the bottom half is trying to pull my eye away from your egg characters.', '2011-12-01 11:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607583, 985939, 69368, '<td valign="top">like this naturally look of this nice familiy portrait</td>', 'like this naturally look of this nice familiy portrait', '2011-12-01 11:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607586, 986082, 69368, '<td valign="top">really like the "plastic-look" here</td>', 'really like the "plastic-look" here', '2011-12-01 11:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607589, 985444, 69368, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. My eyes look move around the table, stop at every person. Like the elderly lady in pink shirt most :-)<br/>Nicly done!</td>', 'I really like this image. My eyes look move around the table, stop at every person. Like the elderly lady in pink shirt most :-)Nicly done!', '2011-12-01 11:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607591, 985414, 69368, '<td valign="top">the only I can say: NO!</td>', 'the only I can say: NO!', '2011-12-01 11:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607592, 986106, 94265, '<td valign="top">Quite a few issues with this image unfortunately which make it a low-scorer for me; the pic needs to be rotated somewhat to the right, the skewed stair rails look odd and without rotation, the angle the boy is standing at looks odd too. The image is quite noisy. The light on the right side of the shot is quite harsh compared to the dull light on the other side. Hardly any detail visible on the boy''s face. I like the general idea and the title but that''s about it I''m afraid.</td>', 'Quite a few issues with this image unfortunately which make it a low-scorer for me; the pic needs to be rotated somewhat to the right, the skewed stair rails look odd and without rotation, the angle the boy is standing at looks odd too. The image is quite noisy. The light on the right side of the shot is quite harsh compared to the dull light on the other side. Hardly any detail visible on the boy''s face. I like the general idea and the title but that''s about it I''m afraid.', '2011-12-01 11:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607595, 986033, 94265, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, great focus on their faces. The contrast is a little dark for me, especially as it really affects the cub''s eyes and makes them appear kinda lifeless. Otherwise, very nice and sweet.</td>', 'Lovely shot, great focus on their faces. The contrast is a little dark for me, especially as it really affects the cub''s eyes and makes them appear kinda lifeless. Otherwise, very nice and sweet.', '2011-12-01 11:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607600, 986131, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is well-taken, the exposure is good and and so is the focus but it''s a bit like a holiday snap (albeit a good one), it doesn''t say ''family'' to me, it suggests more like ''Summertime'' or ''holidays''. Shame about the slight flare next to her ear. Generally it''s a nice happy shot but doesn''t really fit this challenge in my eyes.</td>', 'This is well-taken, the exposure is good and and so is the focus but it''s a bit like a holiday snap (albeit a good one), it doesn''t say ''family'' to me, it suggests more like ''Summertime'' or ''holidays''. Shame about the slight flare next to her ear. Generally it''s a nice happy shot but doesn''t really fit this challenge in my eyes.', '2011-12-01 11:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607605, 986100, 94265, '<td valign="top">I do like this shot (I''m a fan of sillhouetted sunset pics), although I''d have loved to see the colours of the sky pop more so I''d have pushed the saturation of the red and yellow channels up a bit. Their poses are a little bit stiff and obviously posed, I feel a more relaxed posture would have been a bit better. Overall it conveys a nice idea of a united family sharing a nice moment, a thoughtful shot and good composition/exposure.</td>', 'I do like this shot (I''m a fan of sillhouetted sunset pics), although I''d have loved to see the colours of the sky pop more so I''d have pushed the saturation of the red and yellow channels up a bit. Their poses are a little bit stiff and obviously posed, I feel a more relaxed posture would have been a bit better. Overall it conveys a nice idea of a united family sharing a nice moment, a thoughtful shot and good composition/exposure.', '2011-12-01 11:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607614, 985964, 16046, '<td valign="top">Awesome</td>', 'Awesome', '2011-12-01 11:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607616, 985990, 94265, '<td valign="top">It''s a good shot, nice light, good focus, an interesting arrangement. However, without the title, this says ''collector'' more than ''family'' to me. The white thing on the black in the bottom right corner (a reflection maybe, or something behind a see-through cabinet?) is a bit distracting.</td>', 'It''s a good shot, nice light, good focus, an interesting arrangement. However, without the title, this says ''collector'' more than ''family'' to me. The white thing on the black in the bottom right corner (a reflection maybe, or something behind a see-through cabinet?) is a bit distracting.', '2011-12-01 11:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607617, 986028, 16046, '<td valign="top">Priceless</td>', 'Priceless', '2011-12-01 11:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607619, 986100, 16046, '<td valign="top">Outstanding</td>', 'Outstanding', '2011-12-01 11:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607620, 986093, 16046, '<td valign="top">Great idea</td>', 'Great idea', '2011-12-01 11:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607626, 986122, 94265, '<td valign="top">This strikes me as very sad; the child looks unhappy, coupled with the low light and shadows it makes me think this is meant to portray lost family? The photograph of the woman with a plate in front of her is poignant and puts me in mind that this child has lost their mother and is still trying to involve her in the tea party. Whether this was the intent or not, it makes for quite a moving scene. Technically the image is a bit noisy (most noticeable on the wall) but I like it.</td>', 'This strikes me as very sad; the child looks unhappy, coupled with the low light and shadows it makes me think this is meant to portray lost family? The photograph of the woman with a plate in front of her is poignant and puts me in mind that this child has lost their mother and is still trying to involve her in the tea party. Whether this was the intent or not, it makes for quite a moving scene. Technically the image is a bit noisy (most noticeable on the wall) but I like it.', '2011-12-01 12:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607632, 985740, 94265, '<td valign="top">A cute shot of a child with the family pet. Pretty good exposure in the sunlight. Nice colours, that dog is beautiful! The horizon is slanted a little bit, I think this would have benefitted from a wee rotation to the right.</td>', 'A cute shot of a child with the family pet. Pretty good exposure in the sunlight. Nice colours, that dog is beautiful! The horizon is slanted a little bit, I think this would have benefitted from a wee rotation to the right.', '2011-12-01 12:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607643, 985444, 94265, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit too much going on in this shot, makes it a bit busy, so many faces to look at and in a cluttered setting. One corner of the table being visible at the front makes me wish the shot was rotated very slightly to the left to make the horizon even. The exposure/light is good, some amusing faces, mostly good focus and it does portray family, overall a pretty cool shot; just a bit too much happening in it for me.</td>', 'There''s a bit too much going on in this shot, makes it a bit busy, so many faces to look at and in a cluttered setting. One corner of the table being visible at the front makes me wish the shot was rotated very slightly to the left to make the horizon even. The exposure/light is good, some amusing faces, mostly good focus and it does portray family, overall a pretty cool shot; just a bit too much happening in it for me.', '2011-12-01 12:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607647, 985963, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, it''s taken from a good angle, well-exposed and in good focus. However, I feel the girl on the bike is the main focus of the shot and I''d have liked the focus to be mainly on one of the families, for example the woman on the right holding the baby, or the crouching person with the buggy and older child. That said, it''s quite a nice collection of characters anyway.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, it''s taken from a good angle, well-exposed and in good focus. However, I feel the girl on the bike is the main focus of the shot and I''d have liked the focus to be mainly on one of the families, for example the woman on the right holding the baby, or the crouching person with the buggy and older child. That said, it''s quite a nice collection of characters anyway.', '2011-12-01 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607653, 985950, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not personally a fan of image grain at all, or square crops. It''s a nice moment and despite the heavy grain it looks like the focus is Ok, as is the exposure. The bokehd background is good as it stops what looks like a really busy setting being too intrusive. Overall, not bad, it''s just a personal preference of mine that a non-square ratio and clear, non-noisy image is more aesthetically pleasing.</td>', 'I''m not personally a fan of image grain at all, or square crops. It''s a nice moment and despite the heavy grain it looks like the focus is Ok, as is the exposure. The bokehd background is good as it stops what looks like a really busy setting being too intrusive. Overall, not bad, it''s just a personal preference of mine that a non-square ratio and clear, non-noisy image is more aesthetically pleasing.', '2011-12-01 12:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607656, 985889, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the familial connection? Those thick bits of cord wire on the fence are quite distracting (especially the red one), I''d rather this had been taken from a point where they weren''t as visible. Wee bit of noise on the image, a very low denoise would have helped. Funny title.</td>', 'I don''t see the familial connection? Those thick bits of cord wire on the fence are quite distracting (especially the red one), I''d rather this had been taken from a point where they weren''t as visible. Wee bit of noise on the image, a very low denoise would have helped. Funny title.', '2011-12-01 12:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607661, 985980, 94265, '<td valign="top">Always nice to see a different take on a challenge that still meets the challenge in question. Nice bold colouring on the little guys, good DOF; the bokeh is a little noisy, I''d have done a slight denoise on the image. Could be a little sharper.</td>', 'Always nice to see a different take on a challenge that still meets the challenge in question. Nice bold colouring on the little guys, good DOF; the bokeh is a little noisy, I''d have done a slight denoise on the image. Could be a little sharper.', '2011-12-01 12:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607701, 985444, 140518, '<td valign="top">Great shot, almost surreal! I love the different expressions, the lighting, the changing focus. It would have been even better if the bottle didn''t hide the person at the end of the table.</td>', 'Great shot, almost surreal! I love the different expressions, the lighting, the changing focus. It would have been even better if the bottle didn''t hide the person at the end of the table.', '2011-12-01 13:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607711, 985881, 140518, '<td valign="top">Nice shot :) I would try to improve the focus next time - the focus is slightly on the hand instead of on the face.</td>', 'Nice shot :) I would try to improve the focus next time - the focus is slightly on the hand instead of on the face.', '2011-12-01 13:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6607951, 985414, 69034, '<td valign="top">Judge William Adams?</td>', 'Judge William Adams?', '2011-12-01 17:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608063, 985391, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not strongly getting the essence of family from this; maybe a little, in the sense that every family with a kid probably has a room similarly full of toys and a messy bed. If that was your intent, I think a landscape crop would have been better, to get a wider view of the child''s room.</td>', 'I''m not strongly getting the essence of family from this; maybe a little, in the sense that every family with a kid probably has a room similarly full of toys and a messy bed. If that was your intent, I think a landscape crop would have been better, to get a wider view of the child''s room.', '2011-12-01 19:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608066, 985593, 94265, '<td valign="top">I think the contrast needs to be a wee bit darker on this; the highlights are bright and the midtones look Ok but there''s a lack of contrast that I feel would help boost the image. The focus is fine, would''ve liked it to be a little bit sharper; has a nice sisterly feel to it though.</td>', 'I think the contrast needs to be a wee bit darker on this; the highlights are bright and the midtones look Ok but there''s a lack of contrast that I feel would help boost the image. The focus is fine, would''ve liked it to be a little bit sharper; has a nice sisterly feel to it though.', '2011-12-01 19:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608076, 986114, 94265, '<td valign="top">The shot feels a little bit cramped; the young girl doesn''t look entirely comfortable which enhances the cramped feeling (like she knows the camera is there and feels a wee bit nervous or posey.) I think if the shot were taken (or cropped, whichever) further out, it might have helped. It''s a nice scene nonetheless, exposure in the sun is Ok, I like their matching clothing colours.</td>', 'The shot feels a little bit cramped; the young girl doesn''t look entirely comfortable which enhances the cramped feeling (like she knows the camera is there and feels a wee bit nervous or posey.) I think if the shot were taken (or cropped, whichever) further out, it might have helped. It''s a nice scene nonetheless, exposure in the sun is Ok, I like their matching clothing colours.', '2011-12-01 19:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608083, 985702, 94265, '<td valign="top">Every parent has this type of moment so this shot is relatable, nice focus on the two of them and I like the backlighting. That pigeon is a wee bit distracting but not overly so. Would''ve liked the shot to be a bit sharper overall.</td>', 'Every parent has this type of moment so this shot is relatable, nice focus on the two of them and I like the backlighting. That pigeon is a wee bit distracting but not overly so. Would''ve liked the shot to be a bit sharper overall.', '2011-12-01 19:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608091, 986145, 94265, '<td valign="top">This image almost looks like it has some sort of filter over it(?) as the blown highlights on the rocks and the bigger boys'' arm from the sun look a bit strange. I''m not keen on the dull yellow hue on this image, I think it would''ve looked nice in proper colour, especially since the boys are well co-ordinated in blue. It certainly meets the challenge, a nice collection of cheerful brothers; could be sharper overall.</td>', 'This image almost looks like it has some sort of filter over it(?) as the blown highlights on the rocks and the bigger boys'' arm from the sun look a bit strange. I''m not keen on the dull yellow hue on this image, I think it would''ve looked nice in proper colour, especially since the boys are well co-ordinated in blue. It certainly meets the challenge, a nice collection of cheerful brothers; could be sharper overall.', '2011-12-01 19:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608096, 986108, 94265, '<td valign="top">The crop feels cramped, I think this would have worked a little better zoomed back a bit, maybe even in landscape orientation. There''s an unpleasant shadow at the back of the mother and down the right side of the girl''s arm, a different light source may have helped, like a ceiling-bounced flashgun; the light as it is is a bit flat. A sweet idea though (I wish more parents would read to their kids these days!) and a lovely little girl.</td>', 'The crop feels cramped, I think this would have worked a little better zoomed back a bit, maybe even in landscape orientation. There''s an unpleasant shadow at the back of the mother and down the right side of the girl''s arm, a different light source may have helped, like a ceiling-bounced flashgun; the light as it is is a bit flat. A sweet idea though (I wish more parents would read to their kids these days!) and a lovely little girl.', '2011-12-01 19:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608103, 986016, 94265, '<td valign="top">Little shoes beside big ones is a nice idea to illustrate family, i.e an adult and child but I''m not feeling the ''floating'' look. The shoes are sitting in jet black space with no suggestion as to what they''re sitting on, which makes them look a bit floaty - the same often happens to shots on an all-white backdrop. Good focus on the shoes though, nice and sharp on the laces.</td>', 'Little shoes beside big ones is a nice idea to illustrate family, i.e an adult and child but I''m not feeling the ''floating'' look. The shoes are sitting in jet black space with no suggestion as to what they''re sitting on, which makes them look a bit floaty - the same often happens to shots on an all-white backdrop. Good focus on the shoes though, nice and sharp on the laces.', '2011-12-01 19:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608119, 986093, 94265, '<td valign="top">I think I may have prefered a different crop, this one is a bit too long width-wise. Seeing more of the shoes might have enhanced the idea of the whole family. The overall hue is a bit too pinky/reddish. Nice focus though and I like the idea.</td>', 'I think I may have prefered a different crop, this one is a bit too long width-wise. Seeing more of the shoes might have enhanced the idea of the whole family. The overall hue is a bit too pinky/reddish. Nice focus though and I like the idea.', '2011-12-01 19:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608120, 986110, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''ll admit I don''t quite understand the title. I''m not overly keen on the presenceof the older person, for some reason I feel they look a little out of place, possibly because they aren''t directly interacting with the others. I think being unable to see the eyes enhances this. I like the direct eye-contact with the little girl though and I think b&amp;w was a good choice. Good exposure considering the sun.</td>', 'I''ll admit I don''t quite understand the title. I''m not overly keen on the presenceof the older person, for some reason I feel they look a little out of place, possibly because they aren''t directly interacting with the others. I think being unable to see the eyes enhances this. I like the direct eye-contact with the little girl though and I think b&w was a good choice. Good exposure considering the sun.', '2011-12-01 19:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608122, 985222, 138630, '<td valign="top">Definitely think of family when I see a picnic table and it looks as if maybe you took this in the rain?  Too blurry and too much area blown out for me.</td>', 'Definitely think of family when I see a picnic table and it looks as if maybe you took this in the rain?  Too blurry and too much area blown out for me.', '2011-12-01 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608124, 986068, 138630, '<td valign="top">Making a wish?  Looks as if he is saying "YES!"  Nice idea to use just the candle light.  I might have cropped the left a lot to take him off center.</td>', 'Making a wish?  Looks as if he is saying "YES!"  Nice idea to use just the candle light.  I might have cropped the left a lot to take him off center.', '2011-12-01 19:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608126, 986145, 138630, '<td valign="top">Wow, do they look alike!  Great happy smiles -- this looks like one of those situations where several people were taking pictures and they didn''t know where to look LOL  Midday light is sooo difficult -- I would look for full shade next time.</td>', 'Wow, do they look alike!  Great happy smiles -- this looks like one of those situations where several people were taking pictures and they didn''t know where to look LOL  Midday light is sooo difficult -- I would look for full shade next time.', '2011-12-01 19:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608127, 986020, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very sweet moment and I like the composition and back lighting.  It works better for me above the trunks where the background is dark -- not as well across the bottom.  Nice detail.</td>', 'Very sweet moment and I like the composition and back lighting.  It works better for me above the trunks where the background is dark -- not as well across the bottom.  Nice detail.', '2011-12-01 20:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608136, 985974, 46918, '<td valign="top">the light is a little too harsh</td>', 'the light is a little too harsh', '2011-12-01 20:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608142, 985875, 46918, '<td valign="top">nice dof</td>', 'nice dof', '2011-12-01 20:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608234, 986122, 129607, '<td valign="top">What a precious idea! I like this.</td>', 'What a precious idea! I like this.', '2011-12-01 21:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608235, 985682, 129607, '<td valign="top">Cool - I photograph my family members too. Beautiful.</td>', 'Cool - I photograph my family members too. Beautiful.', '2011-12-01 21:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608277, 985974, 136989, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but I''d rather the munchkin in focus than the yard behind.</td>', 'Nice composition but I''d rather the munchkin in focus than the yard behind.', '2011-12-01 22:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608281, 986145, 136989, '<td valign="top">Cute.  The rocks in back compete for attention with your subjects due to the highlights.</td>', 'Cute.  The rocks in back compete for attention with your subjects due to the highlights.', '2011-12-01 22:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608284, 985874, 136989, '<td valign="top">Nice. I''d rather see the sisters though.  Not sure what the slats mean for family.</td>', 'Nice. I''d rather see the sisters though.  Not sure what the slats mean for family.', '2011-12-01 22:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608289, 985682, 136989, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Is that white hair or a highlight? If white hair then perfect.  If not a little on the hot side, especially at top.</td>', 'Very nice.  Is that white hair or a highlight? If white hair then perfect.  If not a little on the hot side, especially at top.', '2011-12-01 22:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608296, 985444, 136989, '<td valign="top">Wow - that''s a lot of mirrors.  Makes picture a bit busy for me but if I ignore that it''s terrific.  Facial expressions varied across family members and "Dad" eating instead of smiling is a riot.</td>', 'Wow - that''s a lot of mirrors.  Makes picture a bit busy for me but if I ignore that it''s terrific.  Facial expressions varied across family members and "Dad" eating instead of smiling is a riot.', '2011-12-01 22:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608301, 985964, 136989, '<td valign="top">Awesome use of silhouettes! Maybe just a little less black around the edges to allow the figures to be more prominent?  Either way ... nicely done.</td>', 'Awesome use of silhouettes! Maybe just a little less black around the edges to allow the figures to be more prominent?  Either way ... nicely done.', '2011-12-01 22:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608870, 985973, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the echo of the second cat and the lighting and focus is in general very nice.  I with the front cat''s face was a little brighter but with basic editing, I guess you can''t do anything about that.</td>', 'I like the echo of the second cat and the lighting and focus is in general very nice.  I with the front cat''s face was a little brighter but with basic editing, I guess you can''t do anything about that.', '2011-12-02 13:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608876, 985357, 138630, '<td valign="top">Good idea -- the preparation certainly takes way longer than the feast and should be acknowledged, too :)  Though it does convey that idea, the image is too cluttered for my taste and I''m not crazy about the "importance" of the window in the composition.</td>', 'Good idea -- the preparation certainly takes way longer than the feast and should be acknowledged, too :)  Though it does convey that idea, the image is too cluttered for my taste and I''m not crazy about the "importance" of the window in the composition.', '2011-12-02 13:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608880, 986109, 138630, '<td valign="top">Clever title and image to go with it.  I like the grouping and the perspective and for me the lens distortion is working for you here.</td>', 'Clever title and image to go with it.  I like the grouping and the perspective and for me the lens distortion is working for you here.', '2011-12-02 13:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608883, 986016, 138630, '<td valign="top">Though I usually like things in odd numbers (as here), this grouping is not quite working for me.  I would prefer to be able to see the back shoe more distinctly and to have another clearly different show rather than the pair of baby shoes -- unless this family has twins which I am going to assume is the case for the purpose of voting here :) Very nice lighting and tones.</td>', 'Though I usually like things in odd numbers (as here), this grouping is not quite working for me.  I would prefer to be able to see the back shoe more distinctly and to have another clearly different show rather than the pair of baby shoes -- unless this family has twins which I am going to assume is the case for the purpose of voting here :) Very nice lighting and tones.', '2011-12-02 13:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609028, 985990, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nicely taken and framed and an excellent idea to represent family.</td>', 'Nicely taken and framed and an excellent idea to represent family.', '2011-12-02 16:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609033, 986106, 138630, '<td valign="top">Only the title, very clever, keeps this from looking like a mistake to me.  I think you could have had nice lighting that showed us his doubtless handsome face and still used this idea, especially if you had been able to find a perspective that put the family portrait a bit more above him.</td>', 'Only the title, very clever, keeps this from looking like a mistake to me.  I think you could have had nice lighting that showed us his doubtless handsome face and still used this idea, especially if you had been able to find a perspective that put the family portrait a bit more above him.', '2011-12-02 16:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609039, 985357, 94265, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice setting, would''ve liked to see it cropped out further to see more; the light is a bit flat but it''s not too bad since the glow from the lamp flame is there. Good DOF. I''m not sure this quite puts me in mind of family, a cosy restaurant certainly though, I suppose you could maybe equate that to a family meal.</td>', 'Looks like a nice setting, would''ve liked to see it cropped out further to see more; the light is a bit flat but it''s not too bad since the glow from the lamp flame is there. Good DOF. I''m not sure this quite puts me in mind of family, a cosy restaurant certainly though, I suppose you could maybe equate that to a family meal.', '2011-12-02 16:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609043, 985227, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the crop here, not much need for the trees up the top half, I''d have rather seen this in landscape format so the right-most boy''s arm and foot weren''t cropped off. Good DOF. The light makes me wish it was in colour though, as the little bit of backlighting on the boys looks like it would have nice warm tones.</td>', 'I''m not keen on the crop here, not much need for the trees up the top half, I''d have rather seen this in landscape format so the right-most boy''s arm and foot weren''t cropped off. Good DOF. The light makes me wish it was in colour though, as the little bit of backlighting on the boys looks like it would have nice warm tones.', '2011-12-02 16:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609293, 985977, 138630, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors and nice dof -- kind of a stretch for the challenge for me.</td>', 'Pretty colors and nice dof -- kind of a stretch for the challenge for me.', '2011-12-02 23:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609295, 985938, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and range of tones.  Love being able to see the girl''s upturned face -- wish I could see at least the mother''s profile, too.</td>', 'Nice composition and range of tones.  Love being able to see the girl''s upturned face -- wish I could see at least the mother''s profile, too.', '2011-12-02 23:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609296, 985593, 138630, '<td valign="top">I quite enjoy outtakes and this looks like one to me.  Very pretty girls.</td>', 'I quite enjoy outtakes and this looks like one to me.  Very pretty girls.', '2011-12-02 23:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609298, 985702, 138630, '<td valign="top">Interesting dynamics here -- makes me wonder what was going on and engaging the viewer is always a good thing.  I like back lighting but the exposure, esp on the girl''s hair and the ground, is a little off here.</td>', 'Interesting dynamics here -- makes me wonder what was going on and engaging the viewer is always a good thing.  I like back lighting but the exposure, esp on the girl''s hair and the ground, is a little off here.', '2011-12-02 23:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609299, 986093, 138630, '<td valign="top">Like this idea a lot and the perspective, too.  Just a bit red for me but that''s a personal choice.  Nice entry.</td>', 'Like this idea a lot and the perspective, too.  Just a bit red for me but that''s a personal choice.  Nice entry.', '2011-12-02 23:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
