(6610594, 986106, 49018, '<td valign="top">Love her expression and connection with the photographer. I am not sure if the soft focus adds or detracts a bit, but then I am unsure which of the two is the main subject, so it probably creates a connection between the two.</td>', 'Love her expression and connection with the photographer. I am not sure if the soft focus adds or detracts a bit, but then I am unsure which of the two is the main subject, so it probably creates a connection between the two.', '2011-12-04 21:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610598, 985444, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective leading to the patriarch, and how him and the old lady look distinctively unconcerned about the photograph being taken. <br/>I am a bit unsure about the bottle in the obstructing the view, was it deliberate?<br/>An higher angle, perhaps from over a chair, would have also given an interesting perspective and perhaps improved DOF at that aperture.</td>', 'I like the perspective leading to the patriarch, and how him and the old lady look distinctively unconcerned about the photograph being taken. I am a bit unsure about the bottle in the obstructing the view, was it deliberate?An higher angle, perhaps from over a chair, would have also given an interesting perspective and perhaps improved DOF at that aperture.', '2011-12-04 21:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
