(6610659, 986108, 2700, '<td valign="top">composition is good, but direct flash on a "portrait" shot creates harsh shadows - notice under the arm and especially behind the head. Instead of using flash, opening up the camera to a higher Fstop (lower number) will allow better low light performance without the flash.</td>', 'composition is good, but direct flash on a "portrait" shot creates harsh shadows - notice under the arm and especially behind the head. Instead of using flash, opening up the camera to a higher Fstop (lower number) will allow better low light performance without the flash.', '2011-12-04 21:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610663, 985357, 2700, '<td valign="top">photo is too busy. unfortunately, you also have taken a picture "AT" the window and have not compensated for the disparity in light in the forground items - while in focus and perfectly viewable, the forground items are less prominent in the picture because of the very harsh direct window light.</td>', 'photo is too busy. unfortunately, you also have taken a picture "AT" the window and have not compensated for the disparity in light in the forground items - while in focus and perfectly viewable, the forground items are less prominent in the picture because of the very harsh direct window light.', '2011-12-04 21:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
