(6611437, 986131, 69446, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the post-processing on this image... the "Dave Hill" look (which is what it reminds me of) doesn''t suit every picture, and I think the lighting in the source image has to be carefully desgined for it to really work.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the post-processing on this image... the "Dave Hill" look (which is what it reminds me of) doesn''t suit every picture, and I think the lighting in the source image has to be carefully desgined for it to really work.', '2011-12-05 18:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
