(6612035, 985973, 74559, '<td valign="top">Beautiful kitties! I like your choice of DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful kitties! I like your choice of DOF.', '2011-12-06 18:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612053, 985414, 115307, '<td valign="top">A powerful photo that has me wanting to vote low by the mere fact that I hate what it depicts. And yet, this is a feeling you created intentionally and powerfully, and that should be rewarded. <br/>This scares the bejeesus out of me and I hope that it is absolutely not common place in your family, though I know it is in some. If a family does this, can it still be considered a family?<br/>Anyways, an 8 from me because you have absolutely succeeded in what you set up to do in telling a powerful story. I still don''t like the photo though :-P</td>', 'A powerful photo that has me wanting to vote low by the mere fact that I hate what it depicts. And yet, this is a feeling you created intentionally and powerfully, and that should be rewarded. This scares the bejeesus out of me and I hope that it is absolutely not common place in your family, though I know it is in some. If a family does this, can it still be considered a family?Anyways, an 8 from me because you have absolutely succeeded in what you set up to do in telling a powerful story. I still don''t like the photo though :-P', '2011-12-06 18:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612109, 985964, 103142, '<td valign="top">I would think it would have to be a Judi. :)<br/> <br/>If not, consider it a compliment!<br/> <br/>I''ve been going back and forth on the negative space. My first thought was that I absolutely loved the negative space!<br/> <br/>My next thought was that it would have been awesome as an extreme panoramic crop.<br/> <br/>My next thought was: Either way it would be awesome, and either way would tell a slightly different story. Beautifully done -- can''t see it getting anything but blue. 9 (voted earlier)</td>', 'I would think it would have to be a Judi. :) If not, consider it a compliment! I''ve been going back and forth on the negative space. My first thought was that I absolutely loved the negative space! My next thought was that it would have been awesome as an extreme panoramic crop. My next thought was: Either way it would be awesome, and either way would tell a slightly different story. Beautifully done -- can''t see it getting anything but blue. 9 (voted earlier)', '2011-12-06 20:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612110, 986099, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very sweet! I like the b&amp;w. I''d be curious what it was like in color, but I assume that color would actually detract from the face a bit. <br/> <br/>Still think it''s amazing that you had puppies just in time for a family challenge. :)</td>', 'Very sweet! I like the b&w. I''d be curious what it was like in color, but I assume that color would actually detract from the face a bit.  Still think it''s amazing that you had puppies just in time for a family challenge. :)', '2011-12-06 20:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
