(6612577, 985414, 7889, '<td valign="top">I guess people only like to see the good and nice side of family life. Show them something that is not disturbs them.<br/>Yes, it is disturbing but this sort of family is far too common in the world. Well done for being brave and showing the side of family life nobody wants to see or believe happens.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I guess people only like to see the good and nice side of family life. Show them something that is not disturbs them.Yes, it is disturbing but this sort of family is far too common in the world. Well done for being brave and showing the side of family life nobody wants to see or believe happens. ', '2011-12-07 02:45:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6612582, 985964, 108580, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. WD. What photography is all about, fun and capturing moments.</td>', 'Brilliant. WD. What photography is all about, fun and capturing moments.', '2011-12-07 03:10:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6612583, 985444, 108580, '<td valign="top">Oh Crap, forever you say? Great mood moment Johanna. WD.</td>', 'Oh Crap, forever you say? Great mood moment Johanna. WD.', '2011-12-07 03:12:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6612591, 985414, 124729, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Sevlow:</b></div><hr/><i> I guess people only like to see the good and nice side of family life. Show them something that is not disturbs them.<br/>Yes, it is disturbing but this sort of family is far too common in the world. Well done for being brave and showing the side of family life nobody wants to see or believe happens. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I totally agree with you. IMHO this is the best picture of this contest!! I gave it 10! :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by Sevlow: I guess people only like to see the good and nice side of family life. Show them something that is not disturbs them.Yes, it is disturbing but this sort of family is far too common in the world. Well done for being brave and showing the side of family life nobody wants to see or believe happens.  I totally agree with you. IMHO this is the best picture of this contest!! I gave it 10! :-)', '2011-12-07 04:37:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6612596, 985444, 109387, '<td valign="top">Two ribbons in a row, congrats!<br/> <br/>Johanna, it''s time for a red and a blue ;-)<br/> <br/>Ciao</td>', 'Two ribbons in a row, congrats! Johanna, it''s time for a red and a blue ;-) Ciao', '2011-12-07 05:23:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6612597, 985464, 49018, '<td valign="top">&gt; That''s a lot of low votes. I didn''t think this was that bad.<br/> <br/>And you shouldn''t, as actually it isn''t that bad at all. Sure, it is a snapshot, but it certainly portraits an idea of family quite effectively. Even without any title or challenge context to help me, I would have thought of family anyway. I think that, because of the kind of pose, many were reminded of some very typical studio photography images whch are normally taken with pretty effective lighting. So they scored it as they would score a botched studio shot rather than an ok, spontaneous snaphot. Had you taken this with natural light it would have probably attracted higher votes. I was surprised this scored so bad, honestly.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-12-07 05:37:00.</i></td>', '> That''s a lot of low votes. I didn''t think this was that bad. And you shouldn''t, as actually it isn''t that bad at all. Sure, it is a snapshot, but it certainly portraits an idea of family quite effectively. Even without any title or challenge context to help me, I would have thought of family anyway. I think that, because of the kind of pose, many were reminded of some very typical studio photography images whch are normally taken with pretty effective lighting. So they scored it as they would score a botched studio shot rather than an ok, spontaneous snaphot. Had you taken this with natural light it would have probably attracted higher votes. I was surprised this scored so bad, honestly.', '2011-12-07 05:29:18.000000', '2011-12-07 05:37:00.000000', 0),
(6612598, 985414, 69324, '<td valign="top">More comments than one votes, looks to me like you came out the winner, thanks.</td>', 'More comments than one votes, looks to me like you came out the winner, thanks.', '2011-12-07 05:50:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6612599, 985631, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent job. congrats.</td>', 'Excellent job. congrats.', '2011-12-07 05:52:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6612600, 985414, 49018, '<td valign="top">I think I have rarely seen such an effective concept development scoring so low, and surely not one scoring so low *because* of its effectiveness. <br/>Any plan for the girl to take drama school?<br/>Very well done, Joshua, congratulations!</td>', 'I think I have rarely seen such an effective concept development scoring so low, and surely not one scoring so low *because* of its effectiveness. Any plan for the girl to take drama school?Very well done, Joshua, congratulations!', '2011-12-07 05:57:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6612602, 985874, 49018, '<td valign="top">Ongoing demolition :)</td>', 'Ongoing demolition :)', '2011-12-07 05:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6612604, 985784, 49018, '<td valign="top">I liked the concept, theatrical and quite threatening :)<br/>Personally, I would have found it even more effective if the long shadow echoed the shape of the two hugging figures, perhaps by letting a bit of light insinuating between them.<br/></td>', 'I liked the concept, theatrical and quite threatening :)Personally, I would have found it even more effective if the long shadow echoed the shape of the two hugging figures, perhaps by letting a bit of light insinuating between them.', '2011-12-07 06:09:53.000000', NULL, 0),
