(6612785, 985444, 19825, '<td valign="top">The essence of family for me -- everyone around noisy table sharing a meal. Great shot -- a ribbon (second one this week), a score over 7 (second one in the last month), a couple of PH honors. You, young lady, are on a roll. Keep it up -- congratulations.</td>', 'The essence of family for me -- everyone around noisy table sharing a meal. Great shot -- a ribbon (second one this week), a score over 7 (second one in the last month), a couple of PH honors. You, young lady, are on a roll. Keep it up -- congratulations.', '2011-12-07 10:57:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6612793, 985414, 94265, '<td valign="top">I guess the harsh reality subject matter didn''t appeal to the masses; in an ''emotional'' or ''gritty'' challenge, this would have ribboned. You were absolutely robbed in my opinion.<br/></td>', 'I guess the harsh reality subject matter didn''t appeal to the masses; in an ''emotional'' or ''gritty'' challenge, this would have ribboned. You were absolutely robbed in my opinion.', '2011-12-07 11:16:09.000000', NULL, 0),
