(6612922, 985444, 117534, '<td valign="top">This is GREAT.. a REAL look at the All american family eating Tday dinner..  I love Grandma on the right, she don''t care just keep on eatin'' and the young girl on the left.. Oh my god I got caught shoveling food in the mouth.. Not to mention the guy on the left with mouth stuffed Full... I just love this it''s so true!!!</td>', 'This is GREAT.. a REAL look at the All american family eating Tday dinner..  I love Grandma on the right, she don''t care just keep on eatin'' and the young girl on the left.. Oh my god I got caught shoveling food in the mouth.. Not to mention the guy on the left with mouth stuffed Full... I just love this it''s so true!!!', '2011-12-07 13:14:36.000000', NULL, 0),
