(6613329, 985974, 49018, '<td valign="top">I am so incredibly dumb :D<br/>When I first saw this one I felt there was something obviously deliberate to it, it reminded of other images I have seen, but I just couldn''t puzzle out the idea behind it. In the end I had my wife have a look and spell it out to me (it took her 3 seconds, good that there is someone with a brain in the family).<br/>It''s really clever and so enjoyable. I am flooded with imagery from every direction, still I very seldom run into something which requires me to use my brain a bit. Wish it would be more often.<br/> <br/>Thanks for this, I loved it :)<br/></td>', 'I am so incredibly dumb :DWhen I first saw this one I felt there was something obviously deliberate to it, it reminded of other images I have seen, but I just couldn''t puzzle out the idea behind it. In the end I had my wife have a look and spell it out to me (it took her 3 seconds, good that there is someone with a brain in the family).It''s really clever and so enjoyable. I am flooded with imagery from every direction, still I very seldom run into something which requires me to use my brain a bit. Wish it would be more often. Thanks for this, I loved it :)', '2011-12-07 20:04:48.000000', NULL, 0),
